        "material": true,
        "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
        "stageFindingIds": {
          "luna": [],
          "terra": [],
          "sol": [
            "Affected packet scope: 12 listed baseline items—1:brown-rice, 2:chicken, 3:chickpea-curry, 5:ginger, 6:green-bean, 7:mango, 8:papaya, 9:shrimp, 10:shweji, 11:spicy-rice-noodles, 12:tofu, and 13:tomato. Reconciliation covers all 13 baseline rows: 10 normalized_match/mismatch, 2 normalized_match/accurately_unavailable, and 1 artifact/not_applicable (4:customize-your-salad)."
          ]
        },
        "expectedGateIds": [],
        "resolution": "Accepted by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
      },
      {
        "findingId": "sol-confirmed-9168bed603a21620",
        "material": true,
        "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
        "stageFindingIds": {
          "luna": [],
          "terra": [],
          "sol": [
            "The nine reconciled salad rows are materially incomplete: the restaurant expressly states that its salads contain peanuts and that some ingredients may have contacted peanuts. These are valid positive and cross-contact disclosures, not deductions from an incomplete menu."
          ]
        },
        "expectedGateIds": [],
        "resolution": "Accepted by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
      },
      {
        "findingId": "sol-confirmed-7abe04b088c8f3d6",
